        "text": "The ball: Reads give its position and velocity from last frame. Each frame it moves by velocity × the frame time (clamped so a stall can't tunnel it through a brick); a free ball that drops below the paddle is lost. In the demo the paddle follows the ball with a little wobble. Bounce works out where the ball goes next.",
