    {
      "id": "bo_roundNote",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 135,
        "y": 528
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "After the ball has moved and the bricks are hit: a new game, a lost ball or a cleared wall puts the ball back on the paddle, where it stays held until a launch. The Write keeps whether it's held; Lives & score keeps the counts.",
        "width": 320,
        "height": 110
      },
      "parentId": "bo_round"
    },
    {
      "id": "bo_bounceNote",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 140,
        "y": 1687
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "The bounce: off the side and top walls and off a broken brick (Switch picks the case); off the paddle, where it lands steers it. While it sits on the paddle it follows it, and a launch sends it up and to the right. The Writes keep position and velocity for next frame's Reads in Ball.",
        "width": 320,
        "height": 120
      },
      "parentId": "bo_bounce"
    }
